  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7216901",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721690101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721690101": {
            "id": "721690101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "This dish certainly does have a very \"Julie\"-esque feel to it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690102"
            ]
          },
          "721690102": {
            "id": "721690102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Parvaneh",
            "text": "In fact, the first time I saw it, I thought it must've come from Mondstadt. But as it turns out, it's a local specialty instead.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690103"
            ]
          },
          "721690103": {
            "id": "721690103",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julie",
            "text": "I bet it tastes just as good as its name sounds, Xudong! C'mon, let's make some, please!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690106"
            ]
          },
          "721690106": {
            "id": "721690106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Oh, it's you, Traveler! Hehe, see, what did I tell you about us meeting again?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690107"
            ]
          },
          "721690107": {
            "id": "721690107",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julie",
            "text": "Xudong's picked up a new recipe from the city! It's called Crab Roe Kourayaki. Pretty good name, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690108"
            ]
          },
          "721690108": {
            "id": "721690108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "It's not that hard to make either. But it does require a great number of crabs...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690109"
            ]
          },
          "721690109": {
            "id": "721690109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "I've prepared some normal crabs, and now I'm looking for some... special ones.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690110"
            ]
          },
          "721690110": {
            "id": "721690110",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Special crabs?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690111"
            ]
          },
          "721690111": {
            "id": "721690111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Exactly! In specific, we're going for the ones that dwell under that Thunder Sakura!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690112"
            ]
          },
          "721690112": {
            "id": "721690112",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Parvaneh",
            "text": "You might as well say \"thunderstruck crabs\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690113"
            ]
          },
          "721690113": {
            "id": "721690113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Well, I'm just curious, you know? I wonder what crabs that live under such circumstances will taste like...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690114"
            ]
          },
          "721690114": {
            "id": "721690114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "However, with lightning flashing all around that tree, I daren't get too close.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690115"
            ]
          },
          "721690115": {
            "id": "721690115",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Parvaneh",
            "text": "My book states that just like before, you just need to touch a Thunder Sakura Bough and cause an Electrogranum to attach to you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690116"
            ]
          },
          "721690116": {
            "id": "721690116",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Parvaneh",
            "text": "And that way, you won't be struck by the lightning from the Thunder Sakura.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690117"
            ]
          },
          "721690117": {
            "id": "721690117",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Parvaneh",
            "text": "But well, you've seen what that tree looks like. I'm not going to risk it based off such a rough summary of a solution.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690118"
            ]
          },
          "721690118": {
            "id": "721690118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Wouldn't it work if we just ran fast enough?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690119"
            ]
          },
          "721690119": {
            "id": "721690119",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Parvaneh",
            "text": "Are you daft? Do you think you can run faster than lightning!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690120"
            ]
          },
          "721690120": {
            "id": "721690120",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julie",
            "text": "Well, why don't we just use a stick to pull those crabs out and stuff...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690121"
            ]
          },
          "721690121": {
            "id": "721690121",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Parvaneh",
            "text": "If you ask me, we might as well dig some ditch nearby. That'll draw both the water and the crabs out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690122"
            ]
          },
          "721690122": {
            "id": "721690122",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Hahaha. Everyone's got their own opinion. That's great, that's great!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690123"
            ]
          },
          "721690123": {
            "id": "721690123",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "If you don't mind, Traveler, could you help us catch a few of the crabs that live under that Thunder Sakura?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690124"
            ]
          },
          "721690124": {
            "id": "721690124",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "If you do, I'll whip up a great feast for you as thanks.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690125"
            ]
          },
          "721690125": {
            "id": "721690125",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Ah, yes. Hang on... Take this bait.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690126"
            ]
          },
          "721690126": {
            "id": "721690126",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "If you're going to catch crabs over there, use these to attract them first.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690127"
            ]
          },
          "721690127": {
            "id": "721690127",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "It should save you some time and effort.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690128"
            ]
          },
          "721690128": {
            "id": "721690128",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Crabs that live near a Thunder Sakura. I wonder how they'll taste..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7216905",
      "subQuestName": "Place bait near the Thunder Sakura",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721690501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721690501": {
            "id": "721690501",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Parvaneh",
            "text": "That book of mine says that if you touch the Thunder Sakura Bough, you won't be hit by any of those lightning bolts around the Thunder Sakura...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690502"
            ]
          },
          "721690502": {
            "id": "721690502",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Parvaneh",
            "text": "But well, you've seen what that tree looks like. I'm not going to risk it based off such a rough summary of a solution."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7216902",
      "subQuestName": "Catch crabs near the Thunder Sakura",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721690201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721690201": {
            "id": "721690201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Ah, Traveler! How goes the crab-catching harvest?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690202"
            ]
          },
          "721690202": {
            "id": "721690202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Oho! This crab looks pretty good. You're a dab hand at this, aren't you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690203"
            ]
          },
          "721690203": {
            "id": "721690203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Well then, since we've got all our ingredients, let's begin cooking post-haste.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690204"
            ]
          },
          "721690204": {
            "id": "721690204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Let me prepare for a while, Traveler. Please wait here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7216903",
      "subQuestName": "Give the captured crab to Xudong",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7216904",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Xudong",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721690301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721690301": {
            "id": "721690301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Kourayaki... Why is it called Kourayaki, I wonder...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690302"
            ]
          },
          "721690302": {
            "id": "721690302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Well, guess we'll make it first and ask questions later.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690303"
            ]
          },
          "721690303": {
            "id": "721690303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Aha, here we go! \"Crab Roe Kourayaki.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690304"
            ]
          },
          "721690304": {
            "id": "721690304",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Julie",
            "text": "I'll have one! Mm-hmm, this is great!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690305"
            ]
          },
          "721690305": {
            "id": "721690305",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Parvaneh",
            "text": "Give me one of the smaller ones. I doubt I'd be able to finish one that's too large...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690306"
            ]
          },
          "721690306": {
            "id": "721690306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "And this serving's for you, Traveler.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690307"
            ]
          },
          "721690307": {
            "id": "721690307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Here, why don't you have a copy of the recipe, too?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690308"
            ]
          },
          "721690308": {
            "id": "721690308",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "This dish shouldn't be too hard to make, so you can try it yourself if you like.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690311"
            ]
          },
          "721690311": {
            "id": "721690311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "We'll probably head for the vicinity of <color=#00E1FFFF>Yashiori Island</color> next. Go look for us there, if you've got the time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690309"
            ]
          },
          "721690309": {
            "id": "721690309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Alright, time to grab a bite for myself, eh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721690310"
            ]
          },
          "721690310": {
            "id": "721690310",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xudong",
            "text": "Hey! Julie! Leave one for me!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7216904",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
